                                "example_id": "78911b77-2b57-42cb-8483-3e7f30ead55a",
                                "sense_id": "705f7ae1-1497-3579-a755-99430cf57ba5",
                                "text": "For whenever she asked him how much he had written, he regularly answered 'Nothing,' smiling at her meanwhile that courteous and Sphingine smile which Mrs Aldwinkle always found so baffling, so pre-eminently 'queer'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8108df98-50eb-4b65-8863-fee7c5d0d3eb",
                                "sense_id": "705f7ae1-1497-3579-a755-99430cf57ba5",
                                "text": "The word I was looking for, I suppose, was \"sphingine\" – I thought of the baleful prehistoric smile of the Mycenaean women."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
